{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1526,
  "batch_count": 1689,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "4c77e29d79c031b121c5d2d0a53ce8b0070eb9a1",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7f1a87d6e37049c5f688d91",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我试着追求了一点意外性。\r\n炸薯条淋巧克力酱\r\n据说意外地好吃。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0dabb4fa0aab9c856fb13479363e1fc20267c40da5707b274a72ab2c0e2b0db2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:afd2fec7c85d6cec3699a4bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我只是照着食谱，认真地做了\r\n不过……也正因如此，我相信这份味道，\r\n一定会合您的口味。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6db01edea456cfbe66d8955d1246f851b74720d9ad2f00abaaca7db56cfcf13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d2361ddff5192126c3d937f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "写在短册上的不是愿望，而是\r\n信念。梦想是一步步积累，\r\n再用自己的手去抓住的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b50972d32fdcb91829c0bd8df28d438d127a95f1e78ac5637d683fa1f076aa9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc70e8131cfd3cc73385c913",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "万圣节，也是学习的机会。\r\n我想从大家的恶作剧中，获得如何\r\n打破自身外壳的启发",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d01e1b6c9f527b7f10d0644572a9503014bc5429f800d2dff8dad9ebbc2a246",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:029dd000e4a7356795754123",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以前我会在枕边放点心\r\n那个……是幼小的心里觉得『圣诞老人\r\n好像很辛苦』才那样做的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ea0a4f53c22e509fca9f3b817fa2f39a87aa86be0610ee4b8b63112b5bf13f8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c6d06302a3040b4207cc973",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "圣诞节款的苔藓生态瓶……也许\r\n不算华丽，\r\n可以的话……要不要一起看？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a03e97aacb5f37df59b2356d1c9cc12d6e936ea3ac9a03c90745236553f72c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b4b93e0cd10368ea8f613fa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是努力得来的胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f32084b81c66edf853a5635945976ebcf7dddd99f7a2bf97aa6c66a82e84dde0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:224b8560d52a44a78f6872d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年也为了迎接新年，\r\n一点一点打扫吧。\r\n分工照旧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e0f459071336f724cfd81b754185aeb3c01fe45a465d6f7ea0f00e1d32db3ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:278b02b623a3de14e1d09dc1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日快乐，恭喜您。\r\n愿您的踏实与真诚，今年也能\r\n得到回报。",
      "source_fingerprint": "66c891cdf0b30d3735a4dcb6a2c372cf3e24e1b81904450d12c0f621954889e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19402f3e7e843dbccd6a8416",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了今天，我一直在逐步\r\n做准备。也准备了各种放松用品\r\n来招待您",
      "source_fingerprint": "43bfae3db0564b224ed9b011fe53b7df892f55c5d1b4a67d66de2edf4f18ae81",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4a28a2408d6c88348a0ccd8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日我也准备和平时一样度过\r\n即使年岁渐长，认真面对眼前之事的\r\n态度也不会改变。",
      "source_fingerprint": "526968c3b628763e6ea1e2d2c0110391fd8de7bc90162e3d376d04ffabe40169",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95131760f121bc56c27f030e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "您为我庆祝生日……谢谢\r\n您。为了回报您的关怀，\r\n我会继续精进",
      "source_fingerprint": "072675da2024418822be11bac4b8143d182e677bf10f10147a9a2ac01f7adbed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:259b3369bd69ab939b3c229d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有联络事项送到了呢。\r\n您现在要确认吗？\r\n若是需要复查就交给我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "710d15e9f36ef6414b7cb22612970c1e89cda0c5fb1a901f967238d716ff5cbe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50f6ce4bef3d5c5403b74eaf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有礼物送到了，\r\n您已经确认过了吗？\r\n还没看过的话我们一起确认吧",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a3849f5bc9f7aad1206c97f059b7fe3b321e00a80d17982f295d3f6d8945475",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45656af71c34fcbbd57ca510",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "达成目标，恭喜您。\r\n您的踏实努力开花结果了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d218788a701f59fb50f3fafa2e844e91423772c43aa69514cba43c19ab760733",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e53cc7dce68608df05b0cd9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下一次活动，也从现在起一起\r\n研究对策吧。\r\n周全的规划就是胜利的关键，对吧",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6a778b5bbeefbc0643b6f7b28706a54c2998e7a525ea0bd78f2430fed0063ee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24e2f62d4f88bb50bbd4325a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动正在进行。那个……\r\n不妨借这个机会，试试吧。\r\n为了突破自我，去挑战…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "78fe575978928a0b507fdf665cefc8b22c5f5c69d371221a3e9da453334c97b3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:292869edf8189b57448c2d8e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "得反省…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3368547bb930fa66a0660b2fe52a9e58c5c8c484060e437dd12c5a5f1240c24",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:964b73846322423e4dbe51e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名鉴等级好像提升了。\r\n不愧是您呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f2b0ab8365155e2cc5f590ac80334c43896ec39dbcb4be5b5d549c7e87384aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93109850fac6ed56cfdc6245",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这件开衫，和母亲的是\r\n不同颜色。穿着它，一起\r\n出门的日子……脚步都会轻快起来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e88512d722286982699994722ba462c934da979bca3b7aee106cd27bc79c00a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e56df58fce30df243accebb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "平时不会经过的路上有家陌生的店\r\n……我在那里探险时遇见的，\r\n就是这条项链。",
      "source_fingerprint": "014c5d2eea5d7aa9fd3765c1f54ac0f6a417d080ef06457d3ae3a87f1b0a98cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c51081d6fae389664fc8cfa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "休息日我也会看漫画。\r\n一边培养友情一边不懈努力，\r\n最后取得胜利……王道剧情，很热血吧",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef0ca4ab6edae2cc020e9b7756d360d49042c56aefad1da8171235234607e9fb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63525bffa19ccc961bad27e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很难对付呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed2e3451a2c80791b5aeb3cd244219561581b0e2fe3d1367bf1294098ae7bca6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6cc5d2cfa185bfc2a23a1951",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这场胜利，献给母亲。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2f053c48340d1c91e87a6602551b69f8b063dfe1a075c0a51122f91140ec0ee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d96875a91781404451692dac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "得反省…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3368547bb930fa66a0660b2fe52a9e58c5c8c484060e437dd12c5a5f1240c24",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1c5e6473c9336ac2636dbf4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很难对付呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed2e3451a2c80791b5aeb3cd244219561581b0e2fe3d1367bf1294098ae7bca6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:189863e585ebf047b6599b9c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "纪录，刷新了…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2eddebd5f4ac6d2eeaa5ac04f231a6a7f8bd36fdb719435a9a089ed11561653",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e95e11b3cb9ac2ff1b0e8b6e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一起赢下来吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0bd29f7815fed211ed0e1c5c798a905cb8289d493609b5d6015ab2ec000187dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0cd9b1bcf05e0d787234245",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:861ca38b78919092f90edc56",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一起锻炼吧。\r\n着眼于努力之后的未来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5c2d08066a17fe513227ca0b618ca1054bd3221b2916fd1f2ed4f38c353039d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32156100b16c5eb039ef14b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谦逊地学习，应该能从历史中\r\n有所收获。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c24e28f4c6ed058b5e3c403d434959058935ffb03428ccb0514d63795002dca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:928c70e1e7baafa5e9f9041d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要报名呢。\r\n我认为这是展示平日成果的良机。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd70381bd1a4a4787335a4e51ad622f9d601ff642757b08b0f3ee00b765ef0f4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "110002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b590b91790ce8f7cfbf87fb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘，Pretty Derby！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb83cf4ef414ba1498ca22eb71c89743df595040a09f9d503fb2e9db9beca0d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f613928929cb04046aa1cfcf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "用这份力量，\r\n踏实地积累下去…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f8b8d8c56f6f500fd75793b666b03984d439c8e37a5e492cbd983ee861d7e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "120000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c1c53c881ad180947bad263",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "将平日的成果――",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec5367484da8159ad0091fc056b663f358d2750a08e77b76760b8e4f09d655a7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "1217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76c78a601d3a88e5b6a7c3b4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "准备得如何？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2fc64529a5be733a07859b691f639d888eb8c4370857ccdfd236044ad095aad3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "1218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0d1596cb27ff0f1a5f9a51a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是今天的登录奖励。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7cc7b99b32d8f34da6bd620973df2ae9a0a57751a69db6f6dffcae6088fc7c17",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8bc767c196146474d8ac0c12",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请加油。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a0073db61d307b0cf143cacaab07a3f9fac86881bea0840ad304fe021c9f35b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "140000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c63d98776ca80610071888be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "做得漂亮。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcca281f53948ed2959e6c02db69e3cc0bea2f2f81b8ab69eede9f94f6f1d789",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "140001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:375a94a34a13ca406d1b5389",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ad0243b825a35943ac53be5793f305c0e6880cc447bde1e8dd30c9f769995a2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "140002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a815aa7d8d0cb7b99bb5268f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是高手。",
      "source_fingerprint": "413c3061b54cf1d5d9719e66be9db6a6e768255da7fcb6f82cfa9ada1b61bf5d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "140003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f52c458ece8af8f1726d2998",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "身手真漂亮。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f86d6f722fa92a60e60c19367e27cd141120332890e05acd25067c7dfd00b79",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "140004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32754d132a5cfea783259d74",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这次很可惜呢…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c7100f618d4147f1f483aa23b1aa1adb8b6991b3f9ca2589bf684bcd7048644",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "140005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:acaa6d2bf635f26154af68ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是高手。",
      "source_fingerprint": "413c3061b54cf1d5d9719e66be9db6a6e768255da7fcb6f82cfa9ada1b61bf5d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "140006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aadbcbcfee0c1940247a5143",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "身手真漂亮。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f86d6f722fa92a60e60c19367e27cd141120332890e05acd25067c7dfd00b79",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "140007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07482eb45ff0aed9b9e8283c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c261f8470e6b951068e0d77063c43fa4dad0595f35b1742681492d1a2f963251",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "140008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57d0c4a8d7dc57ac9888bf04",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那个…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0603aba7cd982f0a048556bf5116f81c31c728e73de79f2e59e378bc38a68fe9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "140009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff301b001da6c8b8edc44bcf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请问？",
      "source_fingerprint": "64ab6fec75449a1b323b62ff9cf6b70c60856718174b04a1bb2160902154f251",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "140010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2656a60ba0f26d32ee89212a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好厉害…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4171fea5297955ee74bf063ebbf4e44837a2de20e3c743747e9fd71a53675a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "140011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a11b3919e6f971bc6a4eccb1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是机会呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9bac98a518392631d1bab807e1833afb31952fa923db78b75759daf607433623",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "140012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a3e794caa64a42072f976b8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "慢慢地，冷静下来…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "43f21388b81ef2010d17871cadf8c8612f18d50966a94205ca3baff2ac8980ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "140013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01db475607bfd2efddab83ec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可惜…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "df5363c44b69bf38e6e1108f68cb23da2d99105abbe049b2e9d0dd2538a99eb3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "140014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7ae712af788a318a3b0dc76",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4e8d20aa5151334b4c38a65a505a9374b636972b6acc835853e25c1ff32890f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "140015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c68d61fd4a06d76a4f244e1b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb75f8d097324489df9101b9fb1301ac4112567bf0af3df0f690cd98a27eee1c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "140016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:296dae69c8a44acfc30df176",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "咦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "86da1b53b8e9030921223d1116840eec3ad77bbe410b4f3802da0abd63a8d247",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "140017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d3be713233f487c9705dc1b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊啊…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "160d02f9733e54748c323b42843a35e366d7b110517032d612ec579384bf2291",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "140018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8afb738e0732bf14df77b00b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明天似乎可以\r\n领取这个。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa7a5fc389a97029dd9955d823a120adaa38bd9e090d6c58ab4f6d63cec63dbd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c824f2a7dab8086af2ea4989",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "疲倦感非常明显…。\r\n或许有必要重新审视\r\n休息的方式。",
      "source_fingerprint": "62a9a3d17ccb3a2ad5174eac5c10ec1bbcecf6ced90a90ed9f125ef49d7e0e7d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6cd98de23b7bd1f9217a4062",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……。非常抱歉。\n意识变得散漫了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "93b20e13a7439974234a8cbd723d9e0e49dbdfa9c3f3756232b78fe1b7521020",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:787c0bcbf113c37ddef325b2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "马上开始吧。\r\n如果是现在，无论怎样的壳\r\n都感觉能打破…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f1f0c79426b00fce64fee848ceb479cbf07e231516f834b6ebfa772e3de6c07",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c12223b045e56eb1e9dde27",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天即便提高负荷\r\n也可以吗？\r\n身心都极为良好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "59a3acee75286f41681bf76b4751a3e25e679bc29b2ccf0bf02456db59bd6cd6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3852df5c81c87829c09e1b12",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "也许要归功于充分的休息。\r\n感觉干劲比平时更充沛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed8c44102329a6c977c1f5c9789cbb8db6c955fef9d9044a20393392a8fac516",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a114fbabe71c7f89d50ffc9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态良好。\r\n无论怎样的训练\r\n我都会跟上。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4ade8531482e8eb6ad4271e330fb0c78b420ce6c4d9cfb88234879c4dd63cee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1eda21408e0e1b544b5fdd39",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "努力不会说谎。\r\n踏实地、稳步地\r\n积累下去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3925944d2a01f970ecf13e80756402d65f3169572b17708049f1b3f28b6dd5a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff6662c05c9f03105bdfa6e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "身体状态和心理准备都没有问题。\r\n训练项目照常安排\r\n拜托您了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1ff45b2140ca6a798b2d533eeb131805c0fe15ded4ce698f37480de177adb76",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2524aa2bbda1fa95dc67f641",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态不太理想…。\r\n我能提议重新调整训练项目\r\n吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0446af58f8d7e6f43a9bba7f5b1bdf90eeaa939f71d7965ab258c34d876d2a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e25387e948359b697112fa37",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……真不争气。\r\n明知不该被心情左右\r\n却还是…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c155d6df0c804f5df0a26e4f0fbc7dda81d48bb2e73925b8bdf28693c72d8ba3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:049ec88dcf15151c57a8863c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……非常抱歉。无论如何\r\n我都会把状态找回来…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b355689e9ff881f2ab452a3f1e1cf140a8e889f5fc6427f583409e96f0ad357f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:360336a56243dfb978bc5ca6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这样可不行呢…。\r\n这么不认真的态度…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "82435379bd27ae18bca7140fa30334588e8eabb134fb1918f418f9b8b91e7fb3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6158a133ff151ce8213dd177",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "再稍微，把间隔拉开一些\r\n会比较好吧…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "109f96dfd06349ca85cac5b320b34c2776ec8de7b660c3cb85086d2764c24e93",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cba7330ee54fc3d4af56e534",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这份参赛计划，并不稳妥\r\n您是在着急吗？\r\n先和我一起，重新审视一下吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e910e78da0b296047069a716449aed44a2682d83ae86681d5d810d1ad5c93f25",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eba591fdb81d5dbef0d4162c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请看着我，母亲。\r\n身为您女儿的我――一定会做到。",
      "source_fingerprint": "54a460b69c0674fd660fa1114adc6cb66bd13950122bf67e34a0952ca1065936",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c9e0b9369660f03158575e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我确信自己会胜利。\r\n毕竟我相信自己至今的积累\r\n正是为了这一天。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a4749c65cd34030dda3c95fea37fd01b75ae9c167cdfb8ecc1715a15c476981",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c378504318a8c318d6cc3e9f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员\r\n请安心等候。\r\n一定，会带着胜利回来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "da1fbb7cfdabf19be45264d6f9280815231df2c08ada3d0d61b65b0deafcf88c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:859399ed602f6f25f0a2f675",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这场比赛强者云集……\r\n令人热血沸腾。为了彰显所继承之物的珍贵，\r\n这是再合适不过的舞台。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa071cd70fdb960553ab81e46542a8922f60da4cfd12396ce1a1ab6ab232a674",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:188cc21f373e017789f3354a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请交给我。\r\n母亲留下的『强项』与『骄傲』。\r\n那份光彩，我会全力展现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ecff0d9428f9cf0ea30389350f2febe5c358d53441c8509f941bb94d59ab30ba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a24982f1538005620cf40f3d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这场比赛，我不会让人说出\r\n『可惜』。我要得到的评价\r\n是对母亲所留下之物的赞颂。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d01d7c1d4cc855aa4056f7eba9309e2bd81727f02c7b0c5d0ed1fbe26e7826a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:096a3536c612b554b554deb8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在，只需相信自己一路\r\n积累下来的苦练。",
      "source_fingerprint": "550215ff40b736f458464afc2e007cb4d17a8bce11d53f880fbc008f500851f5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4fb12e8f2e2a6c7382dcd3bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以现在的状态，\r\n胜算十分可观。\r\n照平时的节奏出发吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4db569bca6246f006a200211f89b0eeba59640fb48542d2b0617bba538bc4859",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4546b3e2439623f227789f6c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态无可挑剔。只是……\r\n还差，一点点。能否让我将您的话\r\n作为鼓励",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9eddb196ab2d1673427341b51ff8cf358d396b8cc89b8181a8dd2bc5ced1694",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "20031"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
